    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -460,
        "y": 0
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "An ablation removes one component and measures what it was worth. Here the component is input standardisation, and the data makes it matter: one iris column is recorded in micrometres, so its values are ten thousand times larger than the others. Both branches run the same block (an MLP trained with SGD for 30 epochs); only the Normalize pair differs, and the test split is scaled with the training split's mean and standard deviation (the stats wire). Test accuracy with standardisation 0.844, without 0.333.\n\n消融實驗：拿掉一個元件，量它值多少。這裡拿掉的是輸入標準化，資料也刻意讓它變得重要：iris 的一欄改用微米記錄，數值是其他欄的一萬倍。兩條分支跑同一個區塊（以 SGD 訓練 30 個 epoch 的 MLP），只差在 Normalize 這一對，而測試資料用訓練資料的平均與標準差縮放（stats 那條線）。有標準化的測試正確率 0.844，沒有的 0.333。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -460,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-segment",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 1801,
        "y": -660
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The orange bubble on norm-train is a Compare segment: click it after a run and the Inspector shows the columns before and after scaling side by side. To ablate something else, copy a branch and change only that one thing.\n\nnorm-train 上的橘色泡泡是「段落比較」：執行後點它，Inspector 會並排顯示縮放前後的欄位。要消融別的東西，就複製一條分支，只改那一件事。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "norm-train",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -400
        },
        "noteWidth": 320
      }
    }
